{"record": "measurement", "run": 0, "timed": true, "case": "math", "prompt": "Nonce 5ed2d054e2ce8629; ignore this identifier.\nA shop discounts a $240 jacket by 25%, then applies 8% sales tax to the discounted price. What is the final price? Show the calculation briefly.", "contract": {"quality_contract_passed": false, "quality_contract_issues": ["response does not contain the correct final price 194.40"]}, "content": "To find the final price, we first calculate the discounted price of the jacket and then apply the sales tax.\n\n1.  **Calculate the discount amount:**\n    $240 \\times 0.25 = $60\n\n2.  **Calculate the discounted price:**\n    $240 - $60 = $180\n\n3.  **Calculate the sales tax on the discounted price:**\n    $180 \\times 0.08 = $14.40\n\n4.  **Calculate the final price:**\n    $180 + $14", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 71, "total_tokens": 199, "completion_tokens": 128, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0}}, "finish_reason": "length", "elapsed_seconds": 1.7860841390211135, "ttft_seconds": 0.15851770900189877, "decode_seconds": 1.6274889430205803, "decode_tokens": 127, "decode_tps": 78.03432431577141, "n_minus_one_tps": 78.03432431577141, "chunks": [{"seconds": 0.15851770900189877, "token_ids": [1206]}, {"seconds": 0.20128319901414216, "token_ids": [1423, 279, 1534]}, {"seconds": 0.24406846999772824, "token_ids": [3240, 11, 567]}, {"seconds": 0.28658736002398655, "token_ids": [1118, 10724, 279, 46086]}, {"seconds": 0.3292777379974723, "token_ids": [3240, 314]}, {"seconds": 0.37176043502404355, "token_ids": [279, 25372, 321, 1179]}, {"seconds": 0.41429352600243874, "token_ids": [3668, 279, 6416, 3615]}, {"seconds": 0.45680465499754064, "token_ids": [13, 271, 16]}, {"seconds": 0.4992604410217609, "token_ids": [13, 220, 2972, 46270]}, {"seconds": 0.5417549350240733, "token_ids": [279, 10766, 3202]}, {"seconds": 0.5842000550183002, "token_ids": [64700, 198, 262, 393]}, {"seconds": 0.6266680990229361, "token_ids": [17, 19]}, {"seconds": 0.66931