{"record": "measurement", "run": 0, "timed": true, "case": "multilingual", "prompt": "Nonce 05a32b25b28d5bcd; ignore this identifier.\n請用繁體中文，以四個簡短條列解釋什麼是寫入時複製（copy-on-write），並包含一個行程 fork 後修改記憶體頁面的例子。", "contract": {"quality_contract_passed": false, "quality_contract_issues": ["response omits copy-on-write"]}, "content": "1. **延遲複製機制**：當多個進程共享同一份資料時，系統僅建立指標指向同一實體記憶體，暫不實際複製資料以節省資源。\n2. **寫入時觸發複製**：僅當某個進程嘗試「寫入」該共享頁面時，作業系統才會觸發中斷，將該頁面複製一份給該進程。\n3. **獨立記憶體空間**：複製完成後，寫入者擁有獨立的記憶體副本，其他進程仍指向原始頁面，確保資料隔離與一致性。\n4. **Fork 實例說明**：父行程 `fork()` 後，子行程與父行程共享記憶體頁面；若子行程修改變數 `x`，系統僅複製 `x` 所在的頁面給子行程，父行程的 `x` 不受影響。", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 69, "total_tokens": 250, "completion_tokens": 181, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0}}, "finish_reason": "stop", "elapsed_seconds": 3.710464864008827, "ttft_seconds": 0.15870843498851173, "decode_seconds": 3.5516833000001498, "decode_tokens": 180, "decode_tps": 50.68019437431046, "n_minus_one_tps": 50.68019437431046, "chunks": [{"seconds": 0.15870843498851173, "token_ids": [16]}, {"seconds": 0.2009963989839889, "token_ids": [13, 2972]}, {"seconds": 0.24354372199741192, "token_ids": [97009]}, {"seconds": 0.28590870098560117, "token_ids": [107907, 132433]}, {"seconds": 0.3281349620083347, "token_ids": [116764]}, {"seconds": 0.3703438979864586, "token_ids": [332, 4960, 97215, 122691]}, {"seconds": 0.4126819270022679, "token_ids": [97257]}, {"seconds": 0.4549440509872511, "token_ids": [96010, 100659]}, {"seconds": 0.4973779039864894, "token_ids": [101825, 96544, 101936]}, {"seconds": 0.5397942310082726, "token_ids": [96688, 3709, 103952]}, {"seconds": 0.5820577880076598, "token_ids": [100256, 98255]}, {"seconds": 0.6243891170015559, "token_ids": [120095]}, {"seconds": 0.6667150279972702, "token_ids": [111198]}, {"seconds": 0.7089766020071693, "token_ids": [101825]}, {"seconds": 0.7512296029890422, "token_ids": [121553]}, {"seconds": 0.7935800109989941, "token_ids": [147642]}, {"seconds": 0.8358588109840639, "token_ids": [3709, 100497]}